\f2 Sarah explicitly asks Hayley to continue investigating Eloise, including the possibility that Project Kebab might eventually be converted into weapons research.\
Hayley reveals that she has already been watching Eloise as part of her role and has found no alternative Gyges-disc programme.\
This scene supplies Hayley with a new investigative emphasis: 
\f1\b weapons potential
